<title>HONG KONG: HK December merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>HK December merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars and year-on-year percentage change) (*** denotes less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>					 Dec 1996	   Nov 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 38.81 (+ 9.1)    36.58 (+13.0)</p>
<p> U.S.				  18.27 (+ 9.9)    19.31 (+11.3)</p>
<p> Japan				  5.91 (- 5.6)     7.08 (+ 3.2)</p>
<p> Germany				3.69 (-15.4)     3.95 (- 3.8)</p>
<p> U.K.				   2.83 (+ 3.8)     3.13 (+ 1.0)</p>
<p>					  Dec 1996	  Nov 1996</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.26 (- 0.2)    5.48 (+ 6.6)</p>
<p> U.S.				   4.85 (- 8.6)    4.56 (- 5.9)</p>
<p> Germany				1.15 (-12.8)    1.00 (- 3.4)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.81 (-16.9)    0.96 (- 5.6)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.91 (-16.1)    0.91 (- 2.1)</p>
<p>					  Dec 1996	  Nov 1996</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p> China				 46.61 (+ 3.2)    48.30 (+ 6.6)</p>
<p> Japan				 18.76 (+ 0.9)    17.71 (+ 3.5)</p>
<p> Taiwan				10.76 (- 2.0)    10.49 (- 4.3)</p>
<p> U.S.				   9.71 (- 3.4)    10.18 (+ 1.7)</p>
<p> Singapore			    6.97 (+ 9.7)     6.77 (- 5.2)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
